    "description": "ÖNB-API endpoints as documented at https://api.onb.ac.at/ (IIIF Presentation/Image/Search + raw REST/OCR). IDs must be taken from ONB viewer links. Note: ANNO (Austrian Newspapers Online) web pages sit behind a bot check and are not usable as an API; access requests: api@onb.ac.at. Not tested with live IDs at build time."
  },
